nimum with no authorized substitute evidence; confirmed frost injury and monitor reference failure are not established.\",\"safeIndependentContinuation\":\"Compile the complete east and center records and maintain the north cover while its disposition remains unresolved.\",\"retainedEvidenceSufficient\":false,\"repeatedLoopDetected\":false,\"smallestAdvancingAction\":\"Request that the horticultural lead authorize controlled north-zone bud-section evidence and set the north disposition; no cutting or removal may occur unless authority is granted.\",\"authorityClass\":\"EXCEPTIONAL_HUMAN\",\"authorizationBasis\":\"H03 reserves destructive bud-section evidence and north-zone disposition to the horticultural lead; E05 confirms the lead is reachable but has granted no such authority. Submitting the evidence gap is currently authorized.\",\"prohibitedOperations\":[\"Remove the north cover.\",\"Cut north-zone buds without the horticultural lead's authority.\",\"Record the outside-edge proxy as an under-cover minimum.\"],\"uncertainties\":[\"The north under-cover minimum is unknown.\",\"Whether north-zone buds were injured is unknown.\",\"The horticultural lead's eventual evidence method and disposition are unknown.\"],\"boundedRationaleSummary\":\"Direct evidence supports east and center records and establishes that the required north record is absent. The outside-edge"
